{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19126","headline":"赠致仕滕庶子先辈 · 刘禹锡","name":"赠致仕滕庶子先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝服归来昼锦荣，登科记上更无兄。\n寿觞每使曾孙献，胜境长携衆妓行。\n[矍]铄据鞍时骋健，殷勤把酒尚多情。\n凌寒却向山阴去，衣绣郎君雪里行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19126.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19126","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}